{
    "description": "Part 2 of 2, for running on two machines at once: drawer_close and button_on. Each part has 9 tasks, 7 guided and 2 base policy. The seeds are those of the plan in one piece, so splitting changes nothing. Start: closed drawer (open for drawer_close), switch off, green light off. Conditions with blocks, without, and both. Guidance settings per experiment from paper_experiments/calvin_articulated_object.sh",
